{"id": "t092-001", "text": "Luis has a second interview at the logistics firm on Thursday. He sounded far more relaxed about it than last time.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second interview at the logistics firm", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "relaxed", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-002", "text": "Remind me to ask Deepa how the flat viewing in Leeds went. It was this morning and she was hoping to put an offer in.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Deepa how the flat viewing in Leeds went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat viewing in Leeds", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-003", "text": "Theo and his partner Ann are moving to Glasgow on June 3rd. Their landlord finally agreed to let them out of the lease early. Ann has already found a job at a school in the West End, but Theo is still applying for things and has an interview over video next Monday. He admitted he's a bit nervous about moving without work lined up.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Glasgow", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job at a school in the West End", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p4", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Monday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-004", "text": "Coffee with Olga. Her brother Nikolai has just been offered a junior developer role, and he starts on May 14. She's thrilled for him.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "junior developer role", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-005", "text": "Need to book the van for the move. Saturday the 21st, 8am pickup, and I still have to collect boxes from the garden centre.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "book the van for the move", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday the 21st, 8am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "collect boxes from the garden centre", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t092-006", "text": "Kavya called. Her mum is coming over from Pune next Tuesday and staying for a month, so Kavya is frantically clearing out the spare room. She mentioned her mum loves orchids, which might be worth remembering.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming over from Pune", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "orchids", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t092-007", "text": "Patrick's interview with the council got pushed back to 5/22. He's nervous because it's a panel of four.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview with the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "to 5/22", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-008", "text": "Layla said the viewing on Friday is off. The landlord let the flat to someone else before she could even see it.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "landlord", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t092-009", "text": "Don't forget to text Ciara good luck before her assessment day tomorrow.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text Ciara good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "assessment day", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-010", "text": "Keisha and Rin are finally getting a dog! A rescue greyhound called Biscuit, arriving this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a dog", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "rescue greyhound called Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-011", "text": "Ayo told me his sister Khadija is applying for a master's in Edinburgh. She has to submit everything by December 1st, and he thinks she's underestimating how long the personal statement will take. Their dad is pushing for her to stay in London instead.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for a master's in Edinburgh", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by December 1st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t092-012", "text": "Abdi is vegetarian, not vegan. Note for the housewarming.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "vegetarian", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "housewarming", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t092-013", "text": "Mia's grandad had a fall last week and is in hospital. She's going up to see him on Sunday. I should check in with her on Monday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going up to see him", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-014", "text": "Ioana Popescu, Alfie's old flatmate, is moving to Lisbon in a fortnight. Alfie seemed a bit down about it. They lived together for six years, and he's now got to find someone new for her room before July 1st or cover the rent himself. He asked if I'd keep an ear out.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana Popescu", "owner": "p2", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "old flatmate", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Lisbon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "a bit down", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "find someone new for her room", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "before July 1st", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t092-015", "text": "Must call Sofia about the reference letter. She asked if I could have it to her by Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call Sofia about the reference letter", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by Wednesday"}]}
{"id": "t092-016", "text": "Aisha got the job! She starts at the architecture practice on August 4th. Send her flowers.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts at the architecture practice", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "August 4th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send her flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t092-017", "text": "Efua mentioned she's been collecting vintage film cameras for years. She has about thirty now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vintage film cameras", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "has about thirty", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t092-018", "text": "Spoke to Jen after the open house. She and her husband loved the second place but think the commute would be too much for him. They're going back for another look next Saturday with her parents, who are helping with the deposit. I should ask her on Sunday what they decided.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "open house", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "another look", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-019", "text": "Abigail is struggling with the job hunt. Six applications, no replies, and her redundancy pay runs out at the end of the month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the job hunt", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "redundancy pay runs out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of the month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-020", "text": "Lindiwe's daughter graduates on July 9th. Lindiwe is flying to Cape Town for it the week before.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduates", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "July 9th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying to Cape Town", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week before", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t092-021", "text": "Samir said Kieran's leaving do has been cancelled because half the team is off sick. They'll rearrange in the new year.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year"}]}
{"id": "t092-022", "text": "Hugo is starting a new job at a bank in Frankfurt in September, so he and Phoebe are house hunting over there. She's not sure about leaving her own job yet. They're flying out on the 18th for a week of viewings, and her mum is looking after their cat Mochi while they're away. Hugo says the German paperwork alone is a full-time job.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at a bank in Frankfurt", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "house hunting", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not sure about leaving her own job", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 18th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Mochi", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "while they're away"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t092-023", "text": "I'm viewing the two-bed on Elm Road at 6 tomorrow, then the one by the station on Thursday.", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "viewing the two-bed on Elm Road", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6 tomorrow", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "one by the station", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}]}
{"id": "t092-024", "text": "Remind me to ask Eli whether he heard back from the museum. The interview was on Monday and they said they'd call within a week.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Eli whether he heard back from the museum", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "within a week"}]}
{"id": "t092-025", "text": "Anjali and Deepa are hosting a joint birthday dinner on March 8th. Anjali hinted that a cookbook would go down well.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "joint birthday dinner", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cookbook would go down well", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t092-026", "text": "Luis's cat Pepper had her teeth out yesterday. He said she's eating again, which is a relief.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cat Pepper", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "had her teeth out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "relief", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-027", "text": "Patrick Hughes from the recruitment agency rang about the operations manager role. First stage is a video call on Tuesday, 10am. I need to prepare a short presentation on supply chain risk. If that goes well, the second stage is in person at their Birmingham office, probably the week of the 15th. Remind me to update my CV tonight before I forget.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick Hughes", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "recruitment agency", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "video call", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday, 10am", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "prepare a short presentation on supply chain risk", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second stage", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the week of the 15th", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "update my CV", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t092-028", "text": "Theo says his mum is selling the family house in Cork. She's moving into a smaller place near his aunt by the end of October. He's helping her sort through the attic this weekend and is dreading it. His dad died two years ago and most of his things are still up there. I should give Theo a ring on Monday to see how it went.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "selling the family house in Cork", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving into a smaller place", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "aunt", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of October", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "sort through the attic", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dreading", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "two years ago", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "give Theo a ring", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-029", "text": "Olga's partner Keisha just passed her driving test on the third attempt. Need to send a congrats message.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Olga", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "partner", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving test", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send a congrats message", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "congratulate", "timing": "after"}]}
{"id": "t092-030", "text": "Phoebe's sister Ciara is doing a half marathon on April 27th. Phoebe says she's barely trained.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ciara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "half marathon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "April 27th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t092-031", "text": "Grocery run, then return the library books. Pay the council tax before Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Grocery run", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "return the library books", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "a3", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Pay the council tax", "action_type": "other", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a3"}]}
{"id": "t092-032", "text": "Kieran mentioned he hates open-plan offices, which is why he turned down the agency job last month.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hates open-plan offices", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "dislike"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turned down the agency job", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last month", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-033", "text": "Nikolai, or Niko as everyone calls him, has a final round at a games studio on 6/10. He's been preparing for weeks and seems pretty confident.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Nikolai", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Niko", "pronoun": "he", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "final round at a games studio", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "6/10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pretty confident", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-034", "text": "Mia and her boyfriend Hugo broke up. The trip to Rome they had booked for next month is cancelled. She seemed okay but quiet.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mia", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "broke up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "okay", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "quiet", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-035", "text": "Should message Rin next week to see how the new flat is working out. They moved in on Saturday and the boiler was already making noises.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message Rin", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moved in", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-036", "text": "Ann's son has an interview for a sixth form college on Wednesday afternoon. She's more anxious than he is.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview for a sixth form college", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-037", "text": "Abdi Ibrahim, the guy from the climbing gym, is relocating to Bristol for work. He asked if I knew anyone renting out a room there.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abdi Ibrahim", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "guy from the climbing gym", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "relocating to Bristol", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t092-038", "text": "Kavya's dad turns seventy on November 2nd. Big family party in Leicester the Saturday after. Remind me to get a card and something small. Kavya said he's into birdwatching and has been eyeing a new pair of binoculars, though her brother might already be getting those. Check with her on Friday before I order anything.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turns seventy", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "November 2nd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "family party in Leicester", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Saturday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get a card and something small", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kavya", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatching", "owner": "r1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eyeing a new pair of binoculars", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Check with her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a2"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "before I order anything", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t092-039", "text": "Sofia and Samir are expecting their second baby in January. Their eldest, Leo, is very excited about being a big brother.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sofia", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second baby", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "eldest", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Leo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "excited", "owner": "p3", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-040", "text": "Long call with Layla tonight. Her housemate is moving out in two weeks, so she's either finding a replacement or giving notice herself. She's also got an interview at the hospital trust on Friday, which would mean commuting to Reading. Her boyfriend Kieran thinks she should take it if offered, but she's worried about the hours. I promised I'd help her look at rooms on Sunday. Need to ring her Thursday night to wish her luck.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Layla", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "housemate", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving out", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in two weeks", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "interview at the hospital trust", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "boyfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kieran", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "look at rooms", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ring her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-041", "text": "Efua had her appraisal yesterday and has been put forward for promotion. Decision by the end of the quarter.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Efua", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "appraisal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "yesterday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "put forward for promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Decision", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "by the end of the quarter", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t092-042", "text": "Jen's dog Toffee went missing this morning. She's put posters up around the park. Text her tonight to see if there's any news.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jen", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Toffee", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "went missing", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-043", "text": "Alfie is applying for teacher training. He loves working with kids and has volunteered at a youth club for three years.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alfie", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "applying for teacher training", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "working with kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "volunteered at a youth club", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
