{"id": "t092-045", "text": "Aisha's brother Ayo moves into his first flat on Saturday. She and their mum are driving the van down from Manchester. He's paying for pizza in exchange.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ayo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves into his first flat", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t092-046", "text": "Need to email Khadija the link to that letting agent in Bristol. She's looking for a one-bed near the university.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "email Khadija the link to that letting agent in Bristol", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "unspecified"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "looking for a one-bed near the university", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t092-047", "text": "Eli has a phone interview with the charity on Monday and a second one with the publisher the Thursday after. On top of that his lease ends on the 30th, so it's a stressful couple of weeks for him. He said he'd let me know how both go.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "phone interview with the charity", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "second one with the publisher", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "interview", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thursday after", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "lease ends", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 30th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "stressful couple of weeks", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-048", "text": "Lindiwe told me she's allergic to nuts. Worth remembering for the dinner next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lindiwe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "allergic to nuts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "diet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dinner", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-049", "text": "Deepa got the flat! Contracts are being signed on May 2nd and she moves on the 16th. Her parents are coming down to help, and her brother Samir has offered his car for the smaller bits.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Deepa", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flat", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Contracts", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 2nd", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moves", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 16th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Samir", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}]}
{"id": "t092-050", "text": "Dr Fischer is retiring at the end of term, according to Abigail. There's a collection going round the department.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dr Fischer", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "retiring", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end of term", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Abigail", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t092-051", "text": "Don't forget to ask Hugo how his visa appointment went. It was Tuesday.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask Hugo how his visa appointment went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Hugo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visa appointment", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t092-052", "text": "Ioana's twins start nursery on September 8th. She's worried they'll struggle to settle.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ioana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "twins", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "nursery", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "September 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-053", "text": "Booked the removal company for June 12th. Final meter readings on the morning of the move.", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "June 12th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Final meter readings", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "move", "event_type": "move", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t092-054", "text": "Patrick was turned down for the head of department role. He took it better than I expected. Maybe take him out for a drink next week.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Patrick", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turned down for the head of department role", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "take him out for a drink", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "meet", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next week", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-055", "text": "Uncle Theo's knee surgery is on Friday. Mum is driving him in, and she said Auntie Olga will stay with him over the weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Uncle Theo", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "knee surgery", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "Mum"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Auntie Olga", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over the weekend"}]}
{"id": "t092-056", "text": "Phoebe told me she's thinking of retraining as a nurse. She's been looking at courses starting next autumn.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Phoebe", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking of retraining as a nurse", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next autumn"}]}
{"id": "t092-057", "text": "Rin's wedding is on 9/14 in Kyoto. She and her fiancée are hoping most people can make it out there. Start looking at flights soon.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "wedding", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "9/14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "fiancée", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Start looking at flights", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "soon", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-058", "text": "Keisha has been really homesick since moving to Toronto in March. Her mum is visiting her over Christmas, which should help. I must call her this weekend.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "homesick", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Toronto", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in March", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "visiting her", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "over Christmas", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "call her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "call", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t092-059", "text": "Anjali says her new manager is great and she's much happier at work now.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Anjali", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "manager", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "happier at work", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t092-060", "text": "Saw Luis and his wife at the market. They're thinking about moving to Valencia next spring, once the kids finish the school year. He's already learning Spanish on his commute and she's been looking at schools near the old town. No firm date yet, but they're going out in a fortnight to view a few places. I should ask him about it when they're back.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Luis", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Valencia", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "learning Spanish", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going out", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "in a fortnight", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him about it", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they're back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
